OL,3,GNEWSAConcrete viaduct is TikTok star's
OL,4,Adream ticket
OL,5,
OL,6,FTikTok star Francis Bourgeois has
OL,7,Fstepped in to support the reopening of
OL,8,Fone of the South West's most striking
OL,9,Frailway landmarks.
OL,11,FVisitors will be able to walk onto the
OL,12,FCannington Viaduct near Lyme Regis this
OL,13,Fweekend for the first time since the
OL,14,FAxminster to Lyme Regis line closed in
OL,15,F1965.
OL,17,FRailway enthusiast and engineer
OL,18,FBourgeois, who has 3.5m followers on
OL,19,FTikTok, visited the viaduct ahead of
OL,20,Fits reopening which will take place at
OL,21,Fsold-out events on Saturday and Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
