OL,3,GNEWSAConcrete viaduct is TikTok star's
OL,4,Adream ticket
OL,5,
OL,6,FStanding on the structure, Bourgeois
OL,7,Fsaid it was "a very rare opportunity"
OL,8,Fand "to see the view that those who
OL,9,Fwould have travelled on the train would
OL,10,Fhave seen is quite special".
